{"pageid":3525,"title":"Version 1.49.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.49.0</span>","revid":15739,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span id=\"Version_1.49.0_.28.F0.9F.92.98_Valentines_Day.7E.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.49.0_(💘_Valentines_Day~!)\">Version 1.49.0 (💘 Valentines Day~!)</span></h2>\n<p><b>February 14th, 2024</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added <span class=\"new\" title=\"Number splitter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTnVtYmVyX3NwbGl0dGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">number splitter</span>, and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Number combiner (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTnVtYmVyX2NvbWJpbmVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">number combiner</span> to <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's Autologistics</a>!</li>\n<li>The following content is limited time for 2 weeks:</li>\n<li>Brought back the <a href=\"/wiki/Rose\" title=\"Rose\">Rose</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Sakura_Blossom\" title=\"Sakura Blossom\">Sakura</a> in their item form</li>\n<li>Brought back <a href=\"/wiki/Teddy\" title=\"Teddy\">Teddy</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Valentines_Balloons\" title=\"Valentines Balloons\">Valentines balloons</a></li>\n<li>Introduced a new <a href=\"/wiki/Lovely_Moai\" title=\"Lovely Moai\">Lovely Moai</a> in Fungi Finds</li>\n<li>New <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_Hanging_Lights\" title=\"Heart Hanging Lights\">Heart Hanging Lights</a> are available at <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Removed classic materials</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.49.1\">Version 1.49.1</span></h2>\n<p><b>February 19th, 2024</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:_2\">C